Package: asys-images
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Roman <roman@nekko.ai>
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Depends: docker.io | docker-ce, zstd
Homepage: https://github.com/glguida/asys
Description: base container images for asys @UPSTREAM@
 Pre-built asys-runtime, asys-workers, asys-worlds, asys-bpmn,
 asys-human-interface and asys-env-default images, loaded into the local
 Docker Engine on installation (or later with asys-images-load). Images are
 tagged with the upstream version and with the ":dev" tag that asys
 @UPSTREAM@ expects. Old image IDs stay in use by running work and can be
 removed with "asys-images-load --prune".
